Package: ENMselect
Type: Package
Title: Evaluate and Select Species Distribution Models Using AUC and MAE
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Kamil", "Konowalik", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "kamil.konowalik@gmail.com")
Description: Tools to evaluate presence-only (or presence-absence) species
    distribution models / ecological niche models using the simultaneous use of
    the area under the ROC curve (AUC) and the mean absolute error (MAE), as
    proposed in Konowalik and Nosol (2021) <doi:10.1038/s41598-020-80062-1>.
    Models are compared through Pareto (non-dominated) ranking, a compromise
    distance to the ideal point, and bootstrap resampling of evaluation points
    that quantifies how robust the selection of each model is.
